{"id":"d7c1a223707e577d","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-bar-induction-ordinal.md","title":"Bar Induction Ordinal Lemma","display":"lem-bar-induction-ordinal — Bar Induction Ordinal Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-bar-induction-ordinal","aliases":["72-lem-bar-induction-ordinal"],"display":"lem-bar-induction-ordinal — Bar Induction Ordinal Lemma","depends_on":["[[72-df-bar-induction]]","[[72-df-transfinite-induction]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Local tree-to-relation induction proof; not an unspecified internal-S theorem","verification_status":"source-and-argument-reviewed","proof_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-bar-induction-ordinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-bar-induction-ordinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-bar-induction-ordinal — Bar Induction Ordinal Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"18fee81c0ec38350\" href=\"?note=18fee81c0ec38350\" title=\"72-df-bar-induction\">72-df-bar-induction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7a118aa517b30e4d\" href=\"?note=7a118aa517b30e4d\" title=\"72-df-transfinite-induction\">72-df-transfinite-induction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local tree-to-relation induction proof; not an unspecified internal-S theorem"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-and-argument-reviewed"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(D\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq D^2\">\\(R\\subseteq D^2\\)</span>。对x∈D，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_x\">\\(T_x\\)</span> 包含空列表以及所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in D^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(u\\in D^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，满足第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_0Rx\">\\(u_0Rx\\)</span> 且后项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u_{i+1}Ru_i\">\\(u_{i+1}Ru_i\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_x(())=x\">\\(q_x(())=x\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_x(u)=u_{|u|-1}\">\\(q_x(u)=u_{|u|-1}\\)</span>（u非空）。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_x:=\\{u\\in T_x:\\neg\\exists y\\in D\\ yRq_x(u)\\}\">\\(L_x:=\\{u\\in T_x:\\neg\\exists y\\in D\\ yRq_x(u)\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7a118aa517b30e4d\" href=\"?note=7a118aa517b30e4d\" title=\"72-df-transfinite-induction\">72-df-transfinite-induction</a> 的元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TI}(D,R,P)\">\\(\\mathrm{TI}(D,R,P)\\)</span>（P⊆D）；树上的Bar与BarInduction见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"18fee81c0ec38350\" href=\"?note=18fee81c0ec38350\" title=\"72-df-bar-induction\">72-df-bar-induction</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[\\forall x\\in D\\ (\\operatorname{Bar}_{T_x}(L_x)\\land\\operatorname{BarInduction}(T_x))]\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\forall P\\subseteq D\\ \\mathrm{TI}(D,R,P).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[\\forall x\\in D\\ (\\operatorname{Bar}_{T_x}(L_x)\\land\\operatorname{BarInduction}(T_x))]\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\forall P\\subseteq D\\ \\mathrm{TI}(D,R,P).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>给定R-progressive P，定义Q_x={u∈T_x:q_x(u)∈P}。终端节点的当前元素无前驱，由progressiveness在空前驱条件下属于P，所以L_x⊆Q_x。每个孩子对应当前元素的一个R前驱，故Q_x满足树progressiveness。应用BI得空列表∈Q_x，即x∈P。对任意x成立。此为清楚的元理论引理；若要在弱理论S内证明它，需把T_x、Q_x、bar断言和可用概括形式化，不能从“可编码”一词自动推出内部证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-bar-induction","status":"resolved","id":"18fee81c0ec38350","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-bar-induction]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-transfinite-induction","status":"resolved","id":"7a118aa517b30e4d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-transfinite-induction]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-transfinite-induction","status":"resolved","id":"7a118aa517b30e4d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[72-df-transfinite-induction]] 的元 $\\mathrm{TI}(D,R,P)$（P⊆D）；树上的Bar与BarInduction见 [[72-df-bar-induction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-bar-induction","status":"resolved","id":"18fee81c0ec38350","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[72-df-transfinite-induction]] 的元 $\\mathrm{TI}(D,R,P)$（P⊆D）；树上的Bar与BarInduction见 [[72-df-bar-induction]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"D\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq D^2","display":false},{"tex":"T_x","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in D^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"u_0Rx","display":false},{"tex":"u_{i+1}Ru_i","display":false},{"tex":"q_x(())=x","display":false},{"tex":"q_x(u)=u_{|u|-1}","display":false},{"tex":"L_x:=\\{u\\in T_x:\\neg\\exists y\\in D\\ yRq_x(u)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TI}(D,R,P)","display":false},{"tex":"[\\forall x\\in D\\ (\\operatorname{Bar}_{T_x}(L_x)\\land\\operatorname{BarInduction}(T_x))]\\ \\longrightarrow\\ \\forall P\\subseteq D\\ \\mathrm{TI}(D,R,P).","display":true}],"bytes":1744,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-187","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-bar-induction-ordinal|lem-bar-induction-ordinal — Bar Induction Ordinal Lemma]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-187","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-lem-bar-induction-ordinal|lem-bar-induction-ordinal — Bar Induction Ordinal Lemma]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-250","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-lem-bar-induction-ordinal|72-lem-bar-induction-ordinal]]"}],"outgoing":["18fee81c0ec38350","7a118aa517b30e4d"]}